# Git attributes for LedgerPilot.
#
# Text hygiene, enforced at the Git layer: every text file is
# stored with LF line endings, on every platform — the same rule
# `.editorconfig` declares to editors (the test suite keeps the
# two files in agreement). Without this, a clone made with
# core.autocrlf on Windows would check text files out with CRLF
# and hand back noisy, whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never line-ending converted or diffed as
# text. This matters concretely for the committed favicon: its
# test suite asserts the file's exact bytes and rendered pixels,
# and a CRLF conversion pass over its BMP entries would corrupt
# both. Declaring it here makes that protection explicit instead
# of relying on Git's content sniffing alone.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
